[{"Author":"Auto","Date":"2025-05-23T01:21:32Z","File":["⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",0,0],"Message":"","SHA":"72a25a7d14a4e1a8699fdb678b2b5b960c34e528"},{"Author":"Nikola Hristov","Date":"2025-05-22T04:41:55Z","File":["⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",0,0],"Message":"docs(LICENSE): Switch to CC0 1.0 Universal license\n\n- Replaces custom Land Public License (LPL v1.0) with CC0 public domain dedication\n- Removes copyleft requirements and complex license compatibility clauses from LPL\n- Aligns with Land project's goal of maximum openness by dedicating work to public domain\n- Simplifies third-party contributions by eliminating patent litigation clauses\n- Retains only CC0's warranty disclaimer and liability limitations\n- Requires no attribution, enabling unrestricted use/modification/distribution\n- Impacts all project components by removing previous LPL obligations while maintaining permissive access","SHA":"f1c2f5065cfd9a3bebab4cfa71fb9f2dd5434d45"},{"Author":"Auto","Date":"2025-05-22T01:21:25Z","File":["⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",0,0],"Message":"","SHA":"2bf0b0896bda445f732a96e158553d80a42ecd29"},{"Author":"Auto","Date":"2025-05-21T01:22:18Z","File":["⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",0,0],"Message":"","SHA":"519e3dd3d98b4141e94e12307e61b86ae0efc388"},{"Author":"Nikola Hristov","Date":"2025-05-20T18:15:42Z","File":["⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",0,0],"Message":"docs(contributing): normalize code of conduct and contribution guideline links\n\n- Standardized URL casing in CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md and CONTRIBUTING.md from uppercase 'HTTPS' to lowercase 'https'\n- Maintains documentation consistency across project governance files\n- Improves markdown readability while preserving link functionality\n- Aligns with common documentation practices observed in open source projects, supporting Land's goal of fostering a collaborative community environment\n\nThis change demonstrates attention to detail in project documentation hygiene without affecting core editor functionality.","SHA":"cd478d1350f1524507280d7c50fba4de876510d4"},{"Author":"Auto","Date":"2025-05-20T01:22:39Z","File":["⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",0